{
  "title": "The Lifer",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/The_Lifer?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-char pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">The Lifer</h2>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOverview\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"nation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oakheart_Highcourt\" title=\"Oakheart Highcourt\">Oakheart Highcourt</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>The Lifer</b> is an NPC that can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Oakheart_Highcourt\" title=\"Oakheart Highcourt\">Oakheart Highcourt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fagaceae_Peninsula\" title=\"Fagaceae Peninsula\">Fagaceae Peninsula</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a>. It is a <a href=\"/wiki/Chop_Chop\" title=\"Chop Chop\">Chop Chop</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Echoes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Echoes\">Echo</a> trapped to play a board game eternally.\n</p><p>After defeating it for the first time, The Lifer can be fought again any time. Some of its buffs may be disabled by submitting a <span class=\"new\" title=\"Stake of Imbalance (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3Rha2Vfb2ZfSW1iYWxhbmNlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Stake of Imbalance</span> at various Terminals around the maze. These buffs may be re-enabled at any time.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Tutorials\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tutorials</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trophies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trophies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tutorials\">Tutorials</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tutorial\"><dl><dt>The Lifer's Game</dt><dd><div class=\"tutorial-detail\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/bb/Tutorial_Adventure_Moving_Pieces.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324183243\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tutorial Adventure Moving Pieces\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Adventure Moving Pieces.png\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Adventure_Moving_Pieces.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/bb/Tutorial_Adventure_Moving_Pieces.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250324183243\" /></a></span><div class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Moving Pieces</b></span><br />Select a piece to preview its landing point, then select the point to move the piece.</div><div class=\"mobile-only\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Moving Pieces</b></span><br />Select a piece to preview its landing point, then select the point to move the piece.</div><hr class=\"mobile-only\" /></div><div class=\"tutorial-detail\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/40/Tutorial_Adventure_Black_Pieces_and_Gates.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324183413\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tutorial Adventure Black Pieces and Gates\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Adventure Black Pieces and Gates.png\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Adventure_Black_Pieces_and_Gates.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/4/40/Tutorial_Adventure_Black_Pieces_and_Gates.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250324183413\" /></a></span><div class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Black Pieces and Gates</b></span><br />When a black piece lands on the outer circle, it <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">opens all gates and maze walls in that direction.</span></div><div class=\"mobile-only\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Black Pieces and Gates</b></span><br />When a black piece lands on the outer circle, it <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">opens all gates and maze walls in that direction.</span></div><hr class=\"mobile-only\" /></div><div class=\"tutorial-detail\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/86/Tutorial_Adventure_Pausing_the_Game.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324183502\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tutorial Adventure Pausing the Game\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Adventure Pausing the Game.png\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Adventure_Pausing_the_Game.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/86/Tutorial_Adventure_Pausing_the_Game.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250324183502\" /></a></span><div class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Pausing the Game</b></span><br />You can pause the game at any time, and <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">all pieces will stay in place.</span></div><div class=\"mobile-only\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Pausing the Game</b></span><br />You can pause the game at any time, and <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">all pieces will stay in place.</span></div><hr class=\"mobile-only\" /></div><div class=\"tutorial-detail\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/62/Tutorial_Adventure_Resetting_the_Game.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324183553\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tutorial Adventure Resetting the Game\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Adventure Resetting the Game.png\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Adventure_Resetting_the_Game.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/6/62/Tutorial_Adventure_Resetting_the_Game.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250324183553\" /></a></span><div class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Resetting the Game</b></span><br />Press the <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">Reset button</span> to restart the game.</div><div class=\"mobile-only\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Resetting the Game</b></span><br />Press the <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">Reset button</span> to restart the game.</div><hr class=\"mobile-only\" /></div><div class=\"tutorial-detail\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Tutorial_Adventure_Game_Rules.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324183658\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tutorial Adventure Game Rules\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Adventure Game Rules.png\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Adventure_Game_Rules.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Tutorial_Adventure_Game_Rules.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250324183658\" /></a></span><div class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Game Rules</b></span><br />The game ends when either side's pieces form a straight line.\n<span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">If black pieces connect, you win</span>; if white pieces connect, the Lifer wins.</div><div class=\"mobile-only\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Game Rules</b></span><br />The game ends when either side's pieces form a straight line.\n<span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">If black pieces connect, you win</span>; if white pieces connect, the Lifer wins.</div></div></dd></dl></div><div class=\"tutorial\"><dl><dt>The Lifer's Buffs</dt><dd><div class=\"tutorial-detail\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Tutorial_Adventure_Terminal_of_Blessings.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324183848\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tutorial Adventure Terminal of Blessings\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Adventure Terminal of Blessings.png\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Adventure_Terminal_of_Blessings.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Tutorial_Adventure_Terminal_of_Blessings.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250324183848\" /></a></span><div class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Terminal of Blessings</b></span><br />Use <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">Sensor</span> to locate the Terminals granting buffs to the Lifer.</div><div class=\"mobile-only\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Terminal of Blessings</b></span><br />Use <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">Sensor</span> to locate the Terminals granting buffs to the Lifer.</div><hr class=\"mobile-only\" /></div><div class=\"tutorial-detail\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/2/28/Tutorial_Adventure_Stake_of_Imbalance.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324183944\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tutorial Adventure Stake of Imbalance\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Adventure Stake of Imbalance.png\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Adventure_Stake_of_Imbalance.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/2/28/Tutorial_Adventure_Stake_of_Imbalance.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250324183944\" /></a></span><div class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Stake of Imbalance</b></span><br />Submit a <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">Stake of Imbalance</span> at a Terminal to remove the buffs.</div><div class=\"mobile-only\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Stake of Imbalance</b></span><br />Submit a <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">Stake of Imbalance</span> at a Terminal to remove the buffs.</div><hr class=\"mobile-only\" /></div><div class=\"tutorial-detail\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f7/Tutorial_Adventure_Choice_of_Life_and_Death.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324184034\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Tutorial Adventure Choice of Life and Death\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"112\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Adventure Choice of Life and Death.png\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Adventure_Choice_of_Life_and_Death.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f7/Tutorial_Adventure_Choice_of_Life_and_Death.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250324184034\" /></a></span><div class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Choice of Life and Death</b></span><br />After submitting the Stakes, you can freely <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">turn The Lifer's buffs on or off</span> through the Terminal.</div><div class=\"mobile-only\"><span class=\"text-help\"><b>Choice of Life and Death</b></span><br />After submitting the Stakes, you can freely <span style=\"color:#ffd12f\">turn The Lifer's buffs on or off</span> through the Terminal.</div></div></dd></dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Enter the designated area)</dt>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Wow! It's a massive board game!</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> But there are only nine circles. Doesn't look like the kind of game you played with Changli.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Yeah, it's more like... some kind of puzzle.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk with the Lifer)</dt>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Leave...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span>: Are you the \"Lifer?\"</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span>: What is this place?</dd>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Leave... here...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span>: Did someone trap you here?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span>: How can I get you out of here?</dd>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Leave... Leave...</dd>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Leave!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span>: (Looks like it wants me to go there.)</dd>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Leave! Here!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Inspect the device by the Lifer)</dt>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> What are these scribbles...</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Sounds like this big guy is pretty tough to beat.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> It says \"the shackles that hold the prisoner\"... Could they be something to weaken its power?</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Maybe you should use your Sensor to check around.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Lose board game)</dt>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Ahahaha!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Win board game)</dt>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Arraaaagh! Darn it!</dd>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Stop... leave!</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Finally! Time to battle!</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Those moving pieces got me so confused... Let's get this over with!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Defeat The Lifer)</dt>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> Seems like this Echo has been locked up here since forever...</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> According to those inscriptions, it doesn't matter who wins or loses the game. It's stuck here guarding this board forever either way.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Maybe it never wanted this at all.</dd>\n<dd><b>Abby:</b> I wonder what kind of life it had before being trapped here...</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Fight the Lifer again)</dt>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Want... to leave...</dd>\n<dd><b>The Lifer:</b> Leave here... Leave!</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trophies\">Trophies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <b>4</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Trophies\" title=\"Trophies\">Trophies</a> obtainable from&#160;<i>The Lifer</i>:\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table sortable alternating-colors-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Trophy\n</th>\n<th>Group\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"></span></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Alpha_Go\" title=\"Alpha Go\">Alpha Go</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exploration:_Rinascita\" title=\"Exploration: Rinascita\"><img alt=\"Exploration: Rinascita\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trophy Rinascita Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trophy_Rinascita_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/03/Trophy_Rinascita_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250111100432\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration:_Rinascita\" title=\"Exploration: Rinascita\">Exploration: Rinascita</a>\n</td>\n<td>Lose to the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">the Lifer</strong> 10 times in the game in <a href=\"/wiki/Oakheart_Highcourt\" title=\"Oakheart Highcourt\">Oakheart Highcourt</a>.\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lifer%27s_Salvation\" title=\"The Lifer&#39;s Salvation\">The Lifer's Salvation</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exploration:_Rinascita\" title=\"Exploration: Rinascita\"><img alt=\"Exploration: Rinascita\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trophy Rinascita Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trophy_Rinascita_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/03/Trophy_Rinascita_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250111100432\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration:_Rinascita\" title=\"Exploration: Rinascita\">Exploration: Rinascita</a>\n</td>\n<td>Defeat the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">the Lifer</strong> in <a href=\"/wiki/Oakheart_Highcourt\" title=\"Oakheart Highcourt\">Oakheart Highcourt</a>.\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Limit_of_Intelligence\" title=\"Limit of Intelligence\">Limit of Intelligence</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exploration:_Rinascita\" title=\"Exploration: Rinascita\"><img alt=\"Exploration: Rinascita\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trophy Rinascita Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trophy_Rinascita_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/03/Trophy_Rinascita_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250111100432\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration:_Rinascita\" title=\"Exploration: Rinascita\">Exploration: Rinascita</a>\n</td>\n<td>Win against the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">the Lifer</strong> in the game in <a href=\"/wiki/Oakheart_Highcourt\" title=\"Oakheart Highcourt\">Oakheart Highcourt</a>.\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Ring_of_The_Lifer\" title=\"The Ring of The Lifer\">The Ring of The Lifer</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Footprints_in_Rinascita_I\" title=\"Footprints in Rinascita I\"><img alt=\"Footprints in Rinascita I\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trophy Rinascita Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trophy_Rinascita_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/03/Trophy_Rinascita_Icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250111100432\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Footprints_in_Rinascita_I\" title=\"Footprints in Rinascita I\">Footprints in Rinascita I</a>\n</td>\n<td>Claim all the treasures guarded by the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">the Lifer</strong>.\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">5\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>The Lifer</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\